01:36.650 --> 01:38.570
My name is Asami.

01:38.570 --> 01:40.700
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:41.580 --> 01:45.250
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:45.250 --> 01:46.870
I'm actually married.

01:48.080 --> 01:52.130
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:53.590 --> 01:58.430
Darling, the tea is ready,
so would you like to take a break?

01:59.010 --> 02:01.720
No thanks; I'll have some later.

02:04.100 --> 02:06.480
Even when it's Sunday...

02:06.480 --> 02:08.060
How boring.

02:08.100 --> 02:12.980
First Couple's Quarrel...

02:16.780 --> 02:19.320
Geez, Darling.

02:19.320 --> 02:22.410
He's been reading books since the break of day.

02:26.910 --> 02:28.920
Hey, don't get in the way.

02:36.050 --> 02:37.510
Oh no!

02:38.010 --> 02:39.510
Hot!

02:40.430 --> 02:43.600
So scalding... it might leave a mark.

02:43.930 --> 02:45.600
I have to cool my hand.

02:49.600 --> 02:53.270
Ahh! It's soaked.

02:53.270 --> 02:54.730
I'm sorry.

02:55.070 --> 02:58.110
It's out-of-print and hard to find.

02:58.110 --> 03:01.240
I'd finally struck gold
at a used bookstore...

03:04.990 --> 03:06.240
If it...

03:07.080 --> 03:11.250
If it <i>was</i> that valuable,
why'd you leave it lying around?

03:12.540 --> 03:16.300
What about me? I burned myself when I spilled the tea.

03:17.210 --> 03:21.380
Is that book more important than me?

03:21.380 --> 03:23.970
O-Of course not!

03:24.510 --> 03:27.520
That's it, let's have some tea! I'll put it on.

03:27.520 --> 03:29.930
Weren't you reading your book?

03:30.520 --> 03:33.770
Feel free to continue doing so upstairs.

03:34.690 --> 03:36.900
I'll be playing with Kuri.

03:37.610 --> 03:38.900
Asami...

03:53.040 --> 03:56.090
Looks like another Sunday's come and gone.

04:33.120 --> 04:35.170
I'll give you some now.

04:35.170 --> 04:38.460
Oh, I'll take care of feeding Kuri.

04:41.380 --> 04:43.340
U-Umm...

04:42.420 --> 04:45.180
It's fine. It's not your fault, Asami.

04:45.510 --> 04:49.180
I'll clean it up. You can rest.

04:55.480 --> 04:58.610
It's my fault, so let <i>me</i> do it!

04:59.690 --> 05:01.440
I told you it's not.

05:02.030 --> 05:03.690
But, I will...

05:04.030 --> 05:04.900
It's fine.

05:04.900 --> 05:06.700
I'm going to do it!

05:06.700 --> 05:08.280
You're not to blame!

05:08.280 --> 05:09.580
I will...

05:20.340 --> 05:23.340
I... I'm sorry. I didn't mean to do that.

05:28.050 --> 05:29.350
Asami!

05:46.950 --> 05:49.030
I really should go look for her.

05:53.700 --> 05:55.790
Hey! Is Asami in?

05:56.870 --> 05:59.790
I brought some steaming hot takoyaki for you guys.

06:00.960 --> 06:02.170
So, where's Asami?

06:02.170 --> 06:04.460
U-Umm... she went shopping.

06:04.460 --> 06:06.010
Really?

06:06.010 --> 06:08.430
I'll be staying here tonight.

06:07.590 --> 06:08.430
Eh!?

06:10.340 --> 06:13.430
It's the kind of night where I don't
feel like going home.

06:14.720 --> 06:17.020
H-He's been front-loading.

06:17.020 --> 06:20.860
I-I'm going to go meet up with Asami.

06:21.560 --> 06:23.570
No, you're keeping me company here!

06:24.110 --> 06:27.490
Shopping, you say?!
She'll be back soon enough, right?

06:27.490 --> 06:29.110
Y-Yeah...

06:34.490 --> 06:37.790
Why did it come to this?

06:37.790 --> 06:40.080
I don't feel like going home.

06:45.380 --> 06:47.470
But I should<i> go home.</i>

06:47.470 --> 06:50.590
I can't let my husband stay hungry.

06:51.340 --> 06:53.600
U-Umm... Father.

06:53.600 --> 06:56.640
I-I really should go meet up with Asami.

06:56.100 --> 06:58.600
Screw that - sit your ass down!!

07:02.730 --> 07:04.230
Good evening!

07:04.610 --> 07:07.990
I thought I'd extend the weekend into Sunday night and beyond.

07:09.990 --> 07:12.990
Father, is the ol' ball-and-chain getting you down?

07:14.240 --> 07:16.490
Yep, something like that.

07:18.370 --> 07:19.870
H-Hey!

07:19.870 --> 07:22.380
That's it; I'm going out to fetch Asami.

07:22.670 --> 07:25.880
What's with that?
We've got a broken record up in here.

07:26.500 --> 07:28.510
She'll be back before you know it!

07:29.010 --> 07:32.390
Did Asami go shopping without a coat?

07:32.390 --> 07:36.010
Yeah... she was in a hurry.

07:37.140 --> 07:40.520
A-Anyway, please keep her father company.

07:41.980 --> 07:44.270
M-Me too!

07:45.440 --> 07:48.280
Let's pound these beers
'til we can't sit straight!

07:48.280 --> 07:50.900
All right, it's time to get <i>four</i> sheets to the wind!

07:58.540 --> 08:00.540
Ahh, Onee-chan!

07:59.830 --> 08:01.330
Welcome back.

08:00.540 --> 08:03.040
Dang you're late. We've got takoyaki.

08:03.040 --> 08:06.290
U-Umm, where's my husband?

08:06.290 --> 08:09.760
He went out to pick you up.

08:12.590 --> 08:14.340
Where could she be?

08:14.930 --> 08:17.350
The other side of the station?

08:17.350 --> 08:20.350
Ichimaru-sensei sure is late.

08:20.350 --> 08:23.850
It's been at least an hour since he left.

08:23.270 --> 08:23.850
Eh?

08:29.820 --> 08:32.990
U-Umm... I'm going out to retrieve him.

08:33.490 --> 08:35.240
Me too...

08:37.700 --> 08:41.450
In and out, out and in...
What're those two doing?

08:44.920 --> 08:47.590
Darling? Darling!

08:58.300 --> 09:00.760
Maybe he's on
the far side of the station?

09:04.850 --> 09:07.650
Guess I'll check the park again.

09:13.740 --> 09:17.450
I should've just gone home earlier,
instead of being so stubborn.

09:19.740 --> 09:22.950
If I had, we wouldn't be in
this lousy situation.

09:35.380 --> 09:36.430
Asami!

09:37.470 --> 09:38.840
Darling.

09:44.060 --> 09:45.850
Asami!

09:51.270 --> 09:53.320
Are you all right, Asami?

09:53.320 --> 09:54.570
Y-Yes.

09:54.570 --> 09:58.410
I couldn't find you no matter where I looked.
I was really worried.

09:58.410 --> 09:59.950
Darling...

10:02.410 --> 10:04.080
You must be cold.

10:09.830 --> 10:11.670
I'm sorry about today.

10:11.670 --> 10:15.130
Don't be. I'm the one who was at fault.

10:15.130 --> 10:18.590
Honestly, I wanted to apologize, but...

10:19.010 --> 10:20.890
...I just couldn't be sincere.

10:21.970 --> 10:23.430
So...

10:24.140 --> 10:25.770
Me too.

10:26.350 --> 10:28.480
I didn't consider your feelings.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.900
Your hands must be
numb from the cold.

10:38.110 --> 10:39.740
Darling.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.830
Darling...!

10:45.120 --> 10:47.580
It may have been our first quarrel...

10:47.910 --> 10:52.210
...but my husband's kindness
still shone through, all the same.

10:52.710 --> 10:56.550
So, keep loving me lots
from now on, 'kay?

11:01.800 --> 11:02.470
Yes?

11:02.720 --> 11:06.350
This is Onohara.
Is Ichimaru-sensei there?

11:06.350 --> 11:07.850
Onohara?

11:08.600 --> 11:10.850
Yes, please wait a moment.

11:11.230 --> 11:13.860
Ichimaru-sensei, there's a call for you.

11:13.860 --> 11:15.690
Ah, thanks.

11:16.190 --> 11:17.570
Hello, this is Ichimaru.

11:18.030 --> 11:20.570
Sorry for the trouble last night.

11:21.030 --> 11:22.280
Father.

11:23.780 --> 11:27.290
Well, I'll be dropping by again,
soon enough.

11:27.790 --> 11:29.910
Sure, no problem.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.380
What's going on here?

11:34.380 --> 11:37.590
Onohara-san's dad is calling up
Ichimaru-sensei to chat...

11:38.050 --> 11:40.340
And what's more, Ichimaru-sensei...

11:40.340 --> 11:42.340
...called him "Father"?

11:52.480 --> 11:54.310
My name is Asami.

11:54.310 --> 11:56.860
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:56.860 --> 12:00.240
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:00.240 --> 12:02.030
I'm actually married.

12:04.740 --> 12:08.870
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

12:10.450 --> 12:13.670
Looks like we're in for a sudden cold snap.

12:14.540 --> 12:16.500
Bon Apetit!

12:19.460 --> 12:21.340
Asami, aren't you eating?

12:21.670 --> 12:24.890
I feel a little light-headed.

12:24.890 --> 12:26.350
My appetite's gone...

12:27.890 --> 12:30.100
There's a nasty cold going around.

12:30.970 --> 12:33.640
Ah! You're a little feverish.

12:35.850 --> 12:38.900
I think I should stay home
from school today.

12:38.900 --> 12:41.780
Good idea. That'd be for the best.

12:41.780 --> 12:44.450
Stay warm and take it easy.

12:44.450 --> 12:46.160
Okay.

12:46.200 --> 12:51.120
Beware of the Cold...

12:54.330 --> 12:57.170
Now, try solving this question.

12:57.170 --> 12:59.420
Bring it up here once you've finished.

13:06.470 --> 13:08.720
I wonder if Asami is all right.

13:19.820 --> 13:21.650
My, look at the time.

13:26.160 --> 13:29.450
Sorry. I completely forgot to feed you, Kuri.

13:32.120 --> 13:34.290
Oh no, it's all gone.

13:49.430 --> 13:50.800
Asami-san!

13:54.930 --> 13:57.230
Huh? Ichimaru-sensei?

13:57.730 --> 14:00.610
He's not at his desk right now.

14:00.900 --> 14:04.900
His little sister Asami-san
collapsed in my store, with a fever.

14:04.900 --> 14:07.400
I've brought her to the hospital, but...

14:07.400 --> 14:09.910
Ah, he just came back in.

14:10.660 --> 14:12.910
Ichimaru-sensei, it's for you.

14:12.910 --> 14:13.700
O-Okay.

14:16.290 --> 14:19.120
Hello. Ahh, Manager.

14:19.500 --> 14:22.880
Eh!? Okay, I understand.

14:22.880 --> 14:24.550
I'll be right there!

14:24.960 --> 14:29.130
Sorry, there's an emergency.
I'm going to have to leave early today.

14:34.350 --> 14:37.230
Did something happen
to Ichimaru-sensei?

14:37.230 --> 14:41.270
His younger sister was taken
to the hospital with a fever.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.360
His sister?

14:42.770 --> 14:45.780
I never knew he had a sister.

14:45.780 --> 14:47.570
I think her name is Asami.

14:47.900 --> 14:49.950
"Asami-san"?

14:49.950 --> 14:52.950
She has the same name as Onohara-san, but...

14:52.950 --> 14:54.580
Surely not.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.540
"Sakuramomogaoka Hospital - Emergency"

14:58.910 --> 15:00.120
Asami!

15:01.330 --> 15:02.580
Manager!?

15:03.170 --> 15:03.960
Onii-san.

15:04.250 --> 15:05.460
Where's Asami?

15:05.460 --> 15:07.260
They're examining her now.

15:07.260 --> 15:09.930
I'm sorry you had to leave work.

15:11.220 --> 15:12.470
Asami, are you all right?

15:12.470 --> 15:14.560
Eh? Why're you here?

15:14.560 --> 15:19.350
They said it was a cold, so I should
take my medicine and get some rest.

15:19.980 --> 15:21.650
I see.

15:22.690 --> 15:24.570
We have to hurry back!

15:25.270 --> 15:26.570
Kuri is...

15:35.660 --> 15:38.790
I'm so sorry, Kuri.
You must have been starving.

15:42.420 --> 15:44.290
Drink up.

15:49.380 --> 15:51.010
A-Asami!

15:55.800 --> 15:58.100
Oh, Asami...

15:58.600 --> 16:01.020
W-What should I do? I know!

16:03.270 --> 16:04.560
Yes?

16:04.560 --> 16:06.570
Ah, Sensei?

16:06.570 --> 16:07.770
Is Sakura-san in?

16:08.190 --> 16:10.820
Mama's at the club right now.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.360
WHAAAAT??

16:10.820 --> 16:12.320
Did something happen?

16:12.700 --> 16:14.490
Asami caught a cold and collapsed!

16:14.490 --> 16:16.330
Asami-oneechan collapsed?

16:18.870 --> 16:21.330
Whoa, it's coming close to 40!

16:22.120 --> 16:24.710
Hey, do you have an ice pillow?

16:24.710 --> 16:26.340
Y-Yeah!

16:27.170 --> 16:28.590
Ice pillow...

16:28.590 --> 16:31.840
Ice pillow, ice pillow...

16:33.340 --> 16:34.590
Found it!

16:36.430 --> 16:37.640
Here it is!

16:37.640 --> 16:40.600
You can't have an ice pillow
without ice water.

16:46.230 --> 16:47.730
Ice, ice...

16:48.150 --> 16:51.740
Argh! There IS no ice!! Ah, that's it!

16:52.070 --> 16:55.610
WHAT?!?! Asami's fever got worse!?

16:55.610 --> 16:58.620
Yeah, it's approaching 40.

16:58.620 --> 17:00.870
Ahh! I forgot my wallet!!

17:00.870 --> 17:03.040
Y-You can pay me later.

17:03.040 --> 17:04.790
T-Thanks. See ya.

17:05.210 --> 17:08.500
I hope Asami-san'll be okay.

17:09.250 --> 17:11.760
Here's the ice pillow, Asami.

17:15.050 --> 17:17.340
You're pretty good at this nursing thing.

17:17.340 --> 17:20.680
Mama always did this for me
when I caught a cold.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.520
I see.

17:24.520 --> 17:25.980
Asami...!

17:26.350 --> 17:29.020
Hey Asami, are you in?

17:29.020 --> 17:31.820
I brought those apples
you like so much!

17:31.820 --> 17:33.530
Oh, it's her father.

17:33.530 --> 17:36.530
What!? She has a fever!?!

17:36.530 --> 17:38.620
Y-Yes.

17:38.620 --> 17:40.030
A-Asami!

17:42.290 --> 17:44.200
Be strong, Asami.

17:46.040 --> 17:47.710
Oww! Hot, hot, hot!

17:47.710 --> 17:51.250
Hey, don't die, Asami!

18:00.430 --> 18:02.220
It's dropped to 38.

18:02.220 --> 18:03.680
Thank goodness!

18:06.600 --> 18:08.690
Asami, are you okay?

18:09.600 --> 18:11.400
Y-You must be hungry.

18:11.400 --> 18:12.190
Yeah.

18:12.520 --> 18:15.320
Then I'll make some rice porridge for you.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.360
What's next?

18:18.360 --> 18:20.450
Ummm... add the garnish, right?

18:20.450 --> 18:22.200
Garnish? Do you have any?

18:22.200 --> 18:23.700
Y-Yes.

18:25.250 --> 18:26.750
Anything works, right?

18:26.750 --> 18:28.750
Hey, get a move on!

18:28.750 --> 18:30.750
Y-Yeah, I'll be right-

18:32.710 --> 18:34.300
What the heck are you doing!?

18:34.300 --> 18:36.010
S-Sorry about that.

18:40.220 --> 18:42.180
Ahh, the rice porridge!!

18:42.180 --> 18:45.600
I was wondering what
the ruckus was about.

18:45.600 --> 18:46.730
Sakura-san?

18:46.730 --> 18:50.690
I heard from San-chan.
Asami collapsed with a cold?

18:50.940 --> 18:53.440
So, how's she feeling?

18:53.440 --> 18:57.860
The worst has passed,
so I wanted to make some porridge for her.

18:57.860 --> 18:59.400
That explains it.

18:59.990 --> 19:02.660
Hey, let me handle the rice porridge.

19:03.870 --> 19:06.830
I'm confident in my porridge,
if nothing else.

19:06.830 --> 19:08.660
And you even have apples.

19:11.420 --> 19:15.210
I put plenty of applesauce into my porridge.

19:15.210 --> 19:19.010
That delicate balance between sourness and sweetness is the spice of life.

19:19.760 --> 19:22.800
Once she eats this,
that cold won't stand a chance.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.390
Here Asami, eat up.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.390
Is it tasty?

19:29.940 --> 19:31.900
Yes, it is.

19:31.900 --> 19:33.310
Glad to hear it.

19:37.650 --> 19:39.070
She'll be fine.

19:39.070 --> 19:42.200
Don't worry, she's in good hands with Ichimaru-sensei.

19:42.200 --> 19:45.080
Drink this. It'll calm you down.

19:47.290 --> 19:48.950
Asami.

19:48.950 --> 19:52.420
I got all flustered,
and couldn't do anything for you.

19:53.750 --> 19:58.170
I'll be right here with you,
so keep fighting the good fight.

20:11.430 --> 20:13.440
Oh, Asami!

20:14.060 --> 20:15.480
How're you feeling?

20:15.480 --> 20:18.320
I'm much better now.

20:18.320 --> 20:19.440
Thank goodness.

20:23.780 --> 20:25.370
Father.

20:25.370 --> 20:29.120
Father! Her temperature's back to normal.

20:29.120 --> 20:30.580
For real?

20:32.660 --> 20:34.920
Thank you. I'm fine now.

20:35.290 --> 20:36.630
Asami...

20:36.630 --> 20:39.960
You should keep resting,
even though your fever's gone down.

20:39.960 --> 20:41.130
Okay.

20:41.590 --> 20:45.220
Thanks for everything.
Asami's gotten better because of you.

20:45.220 --> 20:47.680
If anything comes up,
call me right away.

20:49.720 --> 20:52.180
I guess I'd better get going.

20:52.180 --> 20:53.640
I'll leave the rest to you.

20:53.640 --> 20:55.310
U-Umm...?

20:55.310 --> 20:58.190
Fine, I'll let you stay by her side.

20:59.650 --> 21:01.480
Thank you all.

21:10.410 --> 21:11.700
Asami?

21:14.330 --> 21:15.620
Asami?!

21:15.620 --> 21:17.330
Good morning.

21:17.330 --> 21:19.130
Should you be up?

21:19.420 --> 21:21.840
I don't see why not!

21:22.510 --> 21:25.510
Darling, thank you very much.

21:25.510 --> 21:27.640
For watching over me
this whole time.

21:27.890 --> 21:30.640
Too bad that's all I was able to do.

21:31.060 --> 21:34.060
It's okay.
Just having you there was enough.

21:34.940 --> 21:36.980
As long as you're by my side.

21:36.980 --> 21:38.230
Asami.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.780
Oh my!

21:48.780 --> 21:52.120
Darling... That alone makes me happy.

21:52.490 --> 21:57.000
So please, stand by me forever and ever, 'kay?

22:15.980 --> 22:19.440
All I am is a kitten

22:15.980 --> 22:19.440
watashi wa koneko

22:19.440 --> 22:23.360
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.440 --> 22:23.360
anata hitori dake no

22:23.360 --> 22:30.240
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.360 --> 22:30.240
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.780 --> 22:34.330
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.780 --> 22:34.330
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.330 --> 22:38.500
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.330 --> 22:38.500
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.500 --> 22:41.920
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.500 --> 22:41.920
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.920 --> 22:47.800
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.920 --> 22:47.800
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.800 --> 22:55.180
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.800 --> 22:55.180
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.180 --> 23:02.150
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.180 --> 23:02.150
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.730 --> 23:12.240
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.730 --> 23:12.240
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:28.970 --> 23:44.980
Preview

23:29.920 --> 23:31.680
Asami here.

23:31.680 --> 23:35.430
This is awful!
Iwasaki-sensei showed up at our house.

23:35.430 --> 23:38.100
She's going to find out
that we're married!

23:38.100 --> 23:42.810
So please, love me lots next week too.
